{"title":"Updating the best of 2024 lists","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/910208711/0/marginalrevolution~Updating-the-best-of-lists.html","date":1735632268000,"content":"<p>Here are my additions to the year’s <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/best-movies-of-2024.html\" target=\"_blank\">“best of” movies list</a>:</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/the-return-2.html\" target=\"_blank\">The Return</a></p>\r\n<p>All We Imagine as Light</p>\r\n<p>A Real Pain (didn’t think I would like it, but it is very good)</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/a-complete-unknown.html\" target=\"_blank\">A Complete Unknown</a></p>\r\n<p>Green Border</p>\r\n<p>A strong finish, yes?</p>\r\n<p>I’ve also been listening to <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://open.spotify.com/album/6DlLdXBGCsSDPOV8R2pCl7\" target=\"_blank\">Two Star &amp; the Dream Police</a>, and Mount Eerie’s <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://open.spotify.com/album/7MrfHt0BhMpSDUocMjW0r9\" target=\"_blank\">Night Palace</a>, not recommended for most of you but very good nonetheless.</p>\r\n<p>As for the end of the year surprise book, one of the very best from 2024, there is Helen Castor’s <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Eagle-Hart-Tragedy-Richard-Henry/dp/198213920X/ref=sr_1_1?crid=2FTW7MBCKBJ3I&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.4OkRu_HXFjb8Z5-xyu6NSNl6ufuZG7mZrZQXcwlQx-o6ItCxQyHsVQjS4WQ4jaXlJXJohFzu6I8L9IKcEMT328vpvuGFj56BMrEuu1gl2M_i2Z1IVVWMKfP5uFK_oj_XdZpT7kNpB9gaDX-RYgOz1A.9UiHThaZxumxxh5PCww11uHTdExrTQBtSvwmD8OFFn8&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=the+eagle+and+the+hart+helen+castor&amp;qid=1735599833&amp;sprefix=helen+castor%2Caps%2C88&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">The Eagle and the Hart: The Tragedy of Richard II and Henry IV</a>.  I’ll be writing more about it in 2025.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/updating-the-best-of-2024-lists.html\">Updating the best of 2024 lists</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/910208711/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/910208711/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/910208711/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/910208711/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/910208711/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/910208711/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/updating-the-best-of-2024-lists.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/updating-the-best-of-2024-lists.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/updating-the-best-of-2024-lists.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/20